{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222160","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1522216001:1":{"text":"副官様が急に態度を変えたのは、どうしてです？","source_cn":"副将大人，您怎么能突然变卦呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x584B54B858ED4E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522216002:0":{"text":"トゥーラ様とも話がついてたはず……配給のときに司令官が不在なら、俺たちが出てきて奪う。<style=\"highlight\">それを軍への寄付として回せば</style>、軍の食料が確保できるって――","source_cn":"您之前不是都和忒拉大人商量好了吗？只要放赈灾粮的时候统...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52120487175DF436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522216003:1":{"text":"――うるさい！\nトゥーラが何を命じていたかは知らんが、余計なことをベラベラ話すな！","source_cn":"——闭嘴！\\n不管忒拉交代你去做什么事，都给我把嘴闭严了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x550D57E756EE0812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522216004:0":{"text":"これ以上軽々しく話すなら、貴様の備蓄を回収してやる。いいな？","source_cn":"要是嘴上再没个看门的，什么事都往外抖，就等着我上门没收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B5CB67A36FD31F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522216005:0":{"text":"すっ、すみません！俺としたことが、口が滑って……","source_cn":"对不起，对不起！都是我的错，全是我失言……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC726DF17B88AFFC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522216006:1":{"text":"ですが……配給の件、これからどうしましょう？","source_cn":"但是，赈灾粮的事……之后该怎么做？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBA8ADA06F902FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1522216007:1":{"text":"あの配給は領主の追加命令だ。ペルセウスも承知してる。","source_cn":"赈灾粮是领主下令增设，珀尔修斯也同意了的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81AE4FFB92CB673A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522216008:1":{"text":"城内の平民の状況は深刻だ。これ以上奪うのはやめろ。戦いのためとはいえ、民を見捨てるわけにはいかん。","source_cn":"城内平民的情况也不容乐观……别再和他们抢赈灾粮了。作战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF961D0CCB200FFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522216009:0":{"text":"ペルセウスは今、城内にいる。情報には注意しておけ。今日の件が明るみに出たら……ホーリンにはいられなくなると思え。","source_cn":"而且珀尔修斯现在就在城内，消息灵通着点！今天这事要是被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC559D4816B3219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522216010:1":{"text":"副官様……なぜそこまで司令官を恐れておいでですか？","source_cn":"副将大人，您何必这么怕统帅？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE361C41CC4E21272","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","documen